{% macro cli_main_doc() -%}
Run the command-line interface.
{% if docstring_resolved == 'google' %}
Args:
    argv: Optional argument list. Defaults to ``sys.argv[1:]`` when omitted.

Returns:
    Process exit code ``0`` after a successful greeting.
{% elif docstring_resolved == 'numpy' %}
Parameters
----------
argv : sequence of str, optional
    Argument list. Defaults to ``sys.argv[1:]`` when omitted.

Returns
-------
int
    Process exit code ``0`` after a successful greeting.
{% elif docstring_resolved == 'sphinx' %}
:param argv: Optional argument list. Defaults to ``sys.argv[1:]`` when omitted.
:returns: Process exit code ``0`` after a successful greeting.
{% else %}
Arguments default to ``sys.argv[1:]``. Invalid or blank input is reported through
the argument parser and exits with status ``2``.
{% endif %}
{%- endmacro %}

